{
  "title": "Nutmeg Smoky Algerian Beef Cutlet Brochette",
  "description": "A peppery and fluffy solo dinner dish featuring beef cutlet with a smoky flavor, this Algerian inspired brochette is low in carbs and perfect for a weeknight meal.",
  "cuisine": "Algerian",
